The worst-case delay (WCD) for each TSN flow can be calculated using the following equation:

WCD = (Periodicity * Deadline) / (Bandwidth * Propagation Delay + Switching Delay + Time Synchronization Error)

Where:
- Periodicity is the periodicity of the flow in microseconds.
- Deadline is the deadline of the flow in microseconds.
- Bandwidth is the bandwidth of the link in Mbps.
- Propagation Delay is the propagation delay of the flow in microseconds.
- Switching Delay is the switching delay of the flow in microseconds.
- Time Synchronization Error is the time synchronization error of the flow in microseconds.

